OL,3,GNEWSAMarra to claim Holyrood 'hoarding
OL,4,Apower' in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Marra is set to call for the
OL,7,FScottish government to decentralise
OL,8,Fpower from Holyrood in his first
OL,9,Fconference speech as Scottish Labour
OL,10,Fleader.
OL,12,FMarra will claim the Scottish
OL,13,FParliament has "hoarded money and
OL,14,Fcontrol" in Edinburgh and demand skills
OL,15,Fpolicy is devolved to Scotland's
OL,16,Fregions.
OL,18,FThe MSP for North East Scotland, who
OL,19,Fdefeated Joe Fagan in a vote to replace
OL,20,FAnas Sarwar just over a week ago, will
OL,21,Faddress the first day of the UK Labour
OL,22,Fconference in Liverpool.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
