OL,3,GNEWSAMarra to claim Holyrood 'hoarding
OL,4,Apower' in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is expected to call on the Scottish
OL,7,Fgovernment to put "power and money" in
OL,8,Fthe hands of local people to grow
OL,9,Fregional economies.
